      "title": "CUPE-W2027- BIO1541-CRS CORR 86h",
      "description": "Posted: 2026-10-05\nPart time\n\nPosting Reason: New Position Location where work is to be performed: Main Campus Session: 2027 Winter Semester | Trimestre d'hiver Faculty: Faculté des sciences / Faculty of Science Unit: Department of Biology, Students & Casuals Job Classification: Corrector (CUPE) Posting Type: Cours précis / Specific course Course Title: Introduction à la biologie cellulaire Course Code: BIO1541 Section: A00/B00 Supervisor name (if known): Marc Charette- Elaine Beaulieu Date Posted (YYYY/MM/DD): 2026/10/05 Applications must be received BEFORE (YYYY/MM/DD): 2026/10/23 Description of tasks (hours): Unless specified below, specific allocation of hours to various tasks should be articulated in a description of work negotiated and signed by you and the supervising professor prior to the commencement of work. Recherche / Research:0 Préparation / Preparation:0 Contact avec étudiants / Contact with Students:0 Correction - Notation / Grading:86 Surveillance / Proctoring:0 Formation / Training:0 Autre / Other:0 Number of positions: 8 Expected Enrolment: 280 Work Start Date: January 01, 2027 Work End Date: April 30, 2027 Total Work Hours: 86 Hourly Rate: Correcteur / Corrector : $30.53 ou/or $36.63 (2024-2025) Undergraduate students will be paid at the lower rate; while graduate students will be paid at the higher rate. These rates do not include vacation pay nor statutory pay. Method of Delivery: in person Language of Work: Français | French Requirements and Nature of Work:  Avoir réussi le cours BIO1541 ou les cours équivalent(s). Successful completion of BIO1541  or course equivalent(s).  Doit avoir réussi aux ateliers sur le Système d’Information sur les Matières Dangereuses Utilisées au Travail (SIMDUT) et sur la Loi sur la santé et la sécurité au  travail (Loi SST) /  Successful completion of WHMIS and Occupational Health and Safety workshops  Additional info or requirements: Avoir complété un cours avancé (3/4 année ou gradué) de